{"2766600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Geometry raid", "steam_appid": 2766600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "《Geometry Raid》is a rogue-lite space slash shooter game, the game combines classic barrage shooting and sword slash game elements. By driving a two-part ship,you can shoot and swing tail  to crush the enemy . The game focuses on hardcore physics simulation and maximizing the melee slash experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Hardcore 2D sword melee slash simulation and the multiple genres built around it<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/ae9d8857b3259a4bbc748a7ebdb78cf4.poster.avif?t=1752372048\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/ae9d8857b3259a4bbc748a7ebdb78cf4.webm?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/ae9d8857b3259a4bbc748a7ebdb78cf4.mp4?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hardcore physics collision simulation: The movement of players, enemies, and bullets is simulated by the Godot physics engine to create a realistic sense of impact<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/dbc7804796a0701257005ea2ef05cb17.poster.avif?t=1752372048\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/dbc7804796a0701257005ea2ef05cb17.webm?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/dbc7804796a0701257005ea2ef05cb17.mp4?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Hardcore damage calculation: Inspired by the damage system of riding and slashing, which I incorporated into my game, in-game damage is determined by factors such as quality and relative speed. This means that the faster the relative velocity between objects, the higher the damage caused<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/8872a0eaffb4d11959219f6fa01defc1.poster.avif?t=1752372048\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/8872a0eaffb4d11959219f6fa01defc1.webm?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/8872a0eaffb4d11959219f6fa01defc1.mp4?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/f8337f89a927f3ec560da3dff792e431.poster.avif?t=1752372048\" width=720 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/f8337f89a927f3ec560da3dff792e431.webm?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2766600/extras/f8337f89a927f3ec560da3dff792e431.mp4?t=1752372048\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Geometry Madness is a game in continuous development, and I will be updating it constantly to expand the depth and content of the game.", "about_the_game": "《Geometry Raid》is a rogue-lite space slash shooter game, the game combines classic barrage shooting and sword slash game elements. By driving a two-part ship,you can shoot and swing tail  to crush the enemy . The game focuses on hardcore physics simulation and maximizing the me